      "overview": "The Foundation Level introduces students to the meaning and importance of living a purposeful life. It helps them understand their identity, recognise their value and appreciate their potential. Students explore how purpose relates to education, career choices, personal development and everyday decisions. They are encouraged to develop positive values and take responsibility for their choices and behaviour. By the end of this level, students should have a stronger foundation for making purposeful decisions as they grow.",
