          "introduction": "This module introduces students to the concept of purpose and why it matters in everyday student life. Students explore the vital difference between living intentionally and simply following daily routines, habits, or external expectations from friends and surroundings. They examine how personal identity, natural interests, core values, and future aspirations work together to reveal purpose. Encouraging young people to ask meaningful questions about who they are and what they can contribute, this module builds an initial roadmap for guiding their school choices and future direction.",
